title: $:/language/hypergsd/Settings/

# Contacts additions to the shared Settings string namespace (same key space
# as the main plugin; the sub-plugin owns only these keys).
Contacts/Placement/Caption: Contact tiddlers
Lists/ContactList/Caption: Contact list
Lists/ContactList/Hint: All contacts
Lists/ContactFilter/Caption: Actions by contact
Lists/ContactFilter/Hint: Incomplete next, waiting and future actions with a contact, grouped by contact and filtered by the picked contacts
Lists/WaitingByContact/Caption: Waiting actions list by contact
Lists/WaitingByContact/Hint: Incomplete waiting actions with a contact, grouped by contact
Lists/NextByContact/Caption: Next actions list by contact
Lists/NextByContact/Hint: Incomplete next actions with a contact, grouped by contact
Lists/FutureByContact/Caption: Future actions list by contact
Lists/FutureByContact/Hint: Incomplete future actions with a contact, grouped by contact
Fragments/ContactLink/Caption: Contact link
Fragments/ContactLink/Hint: Icon jumping to the contact, hidden on the contact tiddler and in lists grouped by contact

Pages/Contact/Caption: Contacts dashboard